A [[Sentience|sentient]]<ref name="TLJ" /> [[species]] of ancient '''insectoids''' were active in [[the galaxy]] following the [[Battle of Jakku]]. [[Navigator]]s<ref name="Helmet Collection 61" /> known as the [[Attendants]]<ref name="TLJTVD">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> were members of the [[insectoid]] species.<ref name="Helmet Collection 61" /> At least two of the species were present on the<ref name="TLJ" /> ''[[Supremacy]]'', the [[flagship]] of [[First Order]] [[Supreme Leader]] [[Snoke]]<ref name="TLJTVD">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> in [[34 ABY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates the events of [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']] to [[34 ABY]]. As [[Star Wars: Episode VIII The Last Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VIII ''The Last Jedi'']] takes place immediately after the events of ''The Force Awakens'', it must also take place in approximately 34 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|ABY]].</ref>

